<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19511" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">germĭno</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. n. and <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a.</i> [germen] (post-Aug.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>, <i>to sprout forth</i>,
				<i>put forth</i>, <i>bud</i>, <i>germinate</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">asparagus altissime germinat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					19, 8, 42, § 146</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">13, 24, 46,
				§ 129</span></i>; <i><span class="en">16, 25, 41, § 97</span></i> sqq. et saep.
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>to put forth</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pennas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					30, 11, 30, § 101</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">capillum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 7,
					6, 5, § 42</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to beget</i>, <i>produce</i>, <i><span class="en">Vulg. Isa.
				45, 8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">61, 11</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
